  "bio": "Dani Ultraviolence is a highly skilled tattoo artist located in Koblenz, Germany, known for their intricate floral, black & gray, and illustrative designs. They maintain an exceptional level of cleanliness in their work, ensuring a hygienic environment at the Tattoo and Piercing Studio. Clients appreciate Dani not only for their artistic talent but also for their unwavering commitment to maintaining a spotless and professional workspace.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Coblenz, Rhineland-palatinate, Germany"
